{{also|futtern}}
==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfʏtərn/|[ˈfʏtɐn]}}
* {{audio|de|De-füttern.ogg|audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vüetern}}, from {{inh|de|goh|fuotiren}}, derived from {{m|goh|fuotar}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*fōdrą|t=fodder}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|de|Futter|-n}}. Compare {{cog|nl|voeren|t=to feed}}, dialectal {{m+|en|to [[fodder]]}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|de|futtern}} {{q|obsolete in this sense}}

====Verb====
{{de-verb-weak|füttert|fütterte|gefüttert}}

# to [[feed]] {{gloss|to give food to}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The word is used chiefly with small children and animals, or otherwise when someone raises the food directly to another person’s mouth. For “to provide food” in general the usual word is {{m|de|ernähren}}.

